        "original_id": "35b248a8-e772-5723-bfb1-42c8a7c9383e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Apple-Kneel, flaming volcano, Sourz Apple, Cherry Brandy, volcano bowl\n- Concepts: cocktail ingredients, shot size, group serving vessels\n\nFacts:\n- Apple-Kneel consists of three shots: two Sourz Apple shots and one Cherry Brandy shot.\n- Apple-Kneel uses an average shot glass of about 1.5 ounces, or roughly 45 milliliters, for each shot.\n- The flaming volcano is a large tropical group cocktail made with rum, brandy, pineapple juice, orange juice, almond syrup, and sometimes other ingredients.\n- The flaming volcano is usually served as a multi-user drink in a decorative ceramic volcano bowl with a central raised hub resembling a volcano cone.\n- A volcano bowl typically has a capacity of about 32 US fluid ounces.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
